+
+## Widgets de Conteneur
+
+### 26. TabView (Onglets)
+
+Interface à onglets.
+
+```yaml
+lvgl:
+  widgets:
+    - tabview:
+        id: my_tabs
+        x: 0
+        y: 0
+        width: 100%
+        height: 100%
+        tab_position: TOP  # TOP, BOTTOM, LEFT, RIGHT
+        tabs:
+          - id: tab_home
+            name: "Home"
+            widgets:
+              - label:
+                  text: "Home content"
+
+          - id: tab_settings
+            name: "Settings"
+            widgets:
+              - label:
+                  text: "Settings content"
+```
+
+**Documentation**: [TabView - LVGL 9.4](https://docs.lvgl.io/9.4/details/widgets/tabview.html)
+
+---
+
+### 27. TileView (Vues défilantes)
+
+Vues en grille avec défilement.
+
+```yaml
+lvgl:
+  widgets:
+    - tileview:
+        id: my_tileview
+        x: 0
+        y: 0
+        width: 100%
+        height: 100%
+        tiles:
+          - id: tile1
+            row: 0
+            col: 0
+            dir: HOR  # HOR, VER, ALL
