+
+### 31. Table (Tableau)
+
+Tableau avec lignes et colonnes.
+
+```yaml
+lvgl:
+  widgets:
+    - table:
+        id: data_table
+        x: 50
+        y: 50
+        width: 300
+        height: 200
+        col_count: 3
+        row_count: 4
+        cells:
+          - row: 0
+            col: 0
+            text: "Name"
+          - row: 0
+            col: 1
+            text: "Age"
+          - row: 0
+            col: 2
+            text: "City"
+          - row: 1
+            col: 0
+            text: "Alice"
+          - row: 1
+            col: 1
+            text: "25"
+          - row: 1
+            col: 2
+            text: "Paris"
+```
+
